+     `node experiments/lib/experiment-record.js staggered-refiling occasion-a <followed|ignored> "…"`.
+     <!-- END INJECTED staggered-refiling -->
+   - A rule states its **strength** and **who may change it**, inline.
+   - Its evidence is **cited by id**, not restated: `[E1]`, `[E2]`, allocated in order and
+     **never reused** — a recycled id resolves silently to the wrong entry. Bare id within
+     its own sidecar, qualified outside it. A cited id resolving to nothing is a defect; an
+     entry nothing cites is not.
+9. **Name what retires it** — refuted, superseded, subsumed, purpose gone. **A cap is not a
+   removal condition**: it says when something must go, never which thing.
+10. **Name what will grade it, and it is not you.** Pre-register what would show it working,
+   in a form a later party can answer without asking what you meant.
