+## Amend
+
+1. **Derive the reach; never remember it.** Enumerate from the source that already knows.
+   Recall finds the site you came for and stops, and a comment left at that site is a note
+   next to one of the places. If the reach cannot be derived, say so — the coupling has moved
+   rather than gone.
+2. **Every reliance, not the one that sent you**: prose describing it, checks assuming it,
+   contracts specifying it. **What the change makes stale is part of the change**, not
+   follow-up.
+3. **Re-check the seam, both ends.** An amendment can satisfy the end you are holding and
+   break the other. If no seam was named, name it now.
+4. **Reviewing one nothing disturbed** — are both ends still there, has it ever been watched
+   failing, does its retirement condition still describe anything, has what it was built
+   against moved. **Quiet is not evidence it works**: a guard on a rare irreversible act is
+   silent by design, and low traffic is the signature of what must never be removed. Conclude
+   *sound*, *unsound and here is the amendment*, or *cannot tell from here, and this would
+   tell*.
+
+   <!-- BEGIN INJECTED maintenance -->
+   **Owned by `maintenance`. Do not edit this block here** — it is written by `inject-rules.js` from that mechanism's rules file, and an edit made here is not kept — the next install overwrites it, printing what it took. Change it in [its doc](../../../mechanisms/maintenance/maintenance.doc.md).
+
+   **A mechanism reported due is `/maintain`'s** (the operator, 2026-08-30) — that skill holds how
+   to maintain one at every level, and this is a pointer to it rather than a copy of it. A
+   maintenance **is** an amend, so it returns here for the mechanics; what it does not take from
+   here is which level, how far the cascade runs, or what repair means.
+   
+   **Every amend closes the same way** (the operator, 2026-08-29): amending a mechanism ends
+   with `maintenance-mark.js <slug> rules` — the amend just reviewed those rules, so the mark
+   is honest, and it is how marks come to exist at all. A mechanism nobody has amended or
+   maintained carries no mark, produces no dueness, and is caught only by the never-maintained
+   backlog.
+   <!-- END INJECTED maintenance -->
